  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Wires X and Y are in the same plane, they are perpendicular and carry equal currents. The direction of the magnetic field due to the currents at point B is as shown on the diagram. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the electron flow in X and Y?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of electron flow in X</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of electron flow in Y</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>To the left</td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>To the left</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
